Copy code

sudo apt install postfix
Select: Internet Site
Step 2: Configure
Edit:
Copy code

sudo nano /etc/postfix/main.cf
Set:
Copy code

myhostname = mail.example.com
mydomain = example.com
Step 3: Restart
Copy code

sudo systemctl restart postfix
Step 4: Send Test Mail
Copy code

